  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom into the ultimate sports haven with the custom football comforter set from Jeminise. Featuring a cool, vintage-inspired football graphic set against a patriotic stars and stripes background, this high-quality bedding is the perfect gift for passionate football players, dedicated coaches, and fans of all ages.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Features custom name and number text inputs to make your bedding uniquely yours.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed polyester fabric with whole-piece microfiber filling to prevent clumping and shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Bedroom Decor:</strong> Ideal for boys' rooms, teen bedrooms, or guest spaces, adding a cool, contemporary sports theme.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Twin (68\" x 88\"), Full (78\" x 88\"), Queen (88\" x 88\"), and King (104\" x 88\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Includes 1 Comforter (or Duvet Cover) and optional matching pillowcases or flat sheet.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; quick-drying fabric becomes even fluffier after air drying without heat.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Brushed Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Cool Vintage Football</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Football</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Football Player Flag Pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All Seasons</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine wash with cold water, Tumble dry on low heat, Iron on low/medium heat</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
